      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/scrapy/scrapy/zipball/2.14.2",
      "body": "- Values from the `Referrer-Policy` header of HTTP responses are no longer executed as Python callables. See the [cwxj-rr6w-m6w7](https://github.com/scrapy/scrapy/security/advisories/GHSA-cwxj-rr6w-m6w7) security advisory for details.\r\n- In line with the [standard](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-redirect-fetch), 301 redirects of POST requests are converted into GET requests.\r\n\r\n[Full Changelog](https://docs.scrapy.org/en/latest/news.html#scrapy-2-14-2-2026-03-12)"
