      "body": "Fix for the [CVE-2025-6176](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-6176) security issue: improved protection against decompression bombs in `HttpCompressionMiddleware` for responses compressed using the `br` and `deflate` methods. Requires `brotli >= 1.2.0`.\r\n\r\n[Full changelog](https://docs.scrapy.org/en/latest/news.html#scrapy-2-13-4-2025-11-17)",
