      "body": "- Changed the values for `DOWNLOAD_DELAY` (from ``0`` to ``1``) and `CONCURRENT_REQUESTS_PER_DOMAIN` (from ``8`` to ``1``) in the default project template.\r\n- Fixed several bugs in the engine initialization and exception handling logic.\r\n- Allowed running tests with Twisted 25.5.0+ again and fixed test failures with lxml 6.0.0.\r\n\r\n[See the full changelog](https://docs.scrapy.org/en/2.13/news.html#scrapy-2-13-3-2025-07-02)",
